  "prompt": "Write a query that calculates each user's daily sleep score change compared to their previous night. For each sleep session, show the user_id, sleep_date, sleep_score, and the difference from their previous night's score (score_change). Order results by user_id, then sleep_date. A user's first recorded night will have NULL for score_change since there is no previous night to compare against. Include only sessions where sleep_score is not NULL.",
